Layered over this is an elaborate, asymmetrical coat-cape combination. The sleeves are voluminous, ballooning out dramatically toward the forearms and terminating in wide, layered, frilled cuffs of pale pink and white lace. The shoulders are heavily armored with ornate, multi-layered golden pauldrons designed to look like stylized bird wings, embellished with glowing cyan feathers that radiate soft light.

Draped from her shoulders is a sweeping, dual-layered cape. The exterior fabric matches the hat—a rich midnight blue imbued with glittering star clusters and golden embroidery along the scalloped edges—while the interior glows with a soft, ethereal lavender light. The cape flows outwards dynamically, catching an unseen cosmic wind.

Lower Body Attire and Footwear
The character’s lower body features sleek, high-waisted, form-fitting trousers or leggings in a deep charcoal or midnight black fabric. These leggings are designed to accentuate her long, slender leg line, decorated with intricate, vertical golden pinstripes and filigree that run down the outer sides of her thighs and shins.

At her hips, a decorative lavender and magenta sash or peplum structure flares outward in sharp, geometric points, bridging the transition between her structured vest and her fitted trousers.

Her footwear consists of heavy, stylized thigh-high armored boots that blend seamlessly into her trousers. The boots are reinforced with thick golden greaves, showcasing heavy plating around the shins and knees, matching the bird-wing aesthetic of her shoulder armor. The boots end in substantial, blocky golden heels and reinforced toes, giving her a grounded, powerful stance despite her floating, magical appearance.

Weapon Appearance, Structure, and Aura
The character wields a massive, ornate staff-rifle hybrid that stands nearly as tall as she does, functioning simultaneously as a magical catalyst and a high-caliber firearm. The stock and mid-section of the weapon are crafted from polished, gleaming gold, sculpted with fluid, organic curves and filigree. Embedded near the trigger mechanism is a prominent, glowing cyan orb or power core that pulses with energy.

The barrel of the weapon extends forward into a long, sleek, dark violet conduit wrapped in golden rings, terminating in a flared muzzle that resembles a stylized cannon or musket. The most striking feature is the rear assembly of the staff, which features a beautifully sculpted golden bust of a serene, blindfolded goddess or angel. This figure is crowned with a floating, glowing golden halo.

The entire weapon is enveloped in a powerful, majestic aura; it crackles with golden light particles, cosmic dust, and shimmering celestial energy, projecting a sense of absolute authority and devastating magical firepower.

Ideal Suggested Background Environment
To fully complement the character's design and elevate her presence, she would look exceptional positioned on the wooden deck of a grand, celestial sailing ship navigating through an open cosmos. The background should feature a breathtaking, panoramic expanse of deep space, filled with swirling, multicolored nebulas in hues of turquoise, magenta, and deep indigo. Distant, glowing ringed planets and fields of floating, crystalline asteroids should drift lazily in the distance.

The ship itself should feature glowing, ethereal sails made of pure starlight energy rather than fabric, tied together with golden rigging. The atmosphere should be filled with a radiant, golden solar flare or a sweeping aurora borealis that casts a warm, divine rim-light along her silhouette, accentuating her cosmic wings and the reflective surfaces of her golden armor. This environment perfectly mirrors her themes of cosmic exploration, magical dominance, and celestial royalty.






